  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society in Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Supporting an enabling environment for civil society for a more inclusive participation in development policy and the decision-making processes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Strengthen capacities and opportunities of civil society and grassroots organisations across all its dimensions in EU priority areas to engage in gender equality, youth and people with disabilities social inclusion, empowerment and human rights. To establish a funding mechanism (e.g. through financial support to third parties) that provides different types of support tailor-made to the size and capacity of civil society actors.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot; class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Support the role of CSOs in the promotion of fundamental values, good governance, policy development and the protection of human rights through women, people with disabilities and youth coalitions/platforms.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
